    "content_type": "text/markdown; charset=utf-8",
    "links": [],
    "preview": "---\ntitle: Post-install event data\nproduct: Unity Grow\ncanonical: https://docs.unity.com/en-us/grow/acquire/partner-integration/app-data/post-install-event-data\nlast_updated: 2026-11-18\ngenerated_at: 2026-11-20T04:44:11.337Z\nlocale: en-us\n---\n\n# Post-install event data\n\n> Pass post-install event data from your app to Unity Ads through an MMP to optimize user acquisition campaigns based on real user engagement, such as sessions, purchases, ad revenue, and level completions.\n\nUnity Ads User Acquisition campaigns that are optimized for acquiring particular kinds of users, such as [Retention](/grow/acquire/campaigns/retention/retention-campaigns.md), [Return on Ad Spend](/grow/acquire/campaigns/roas/return-on-ad-spend-campaigns.md) (ROAS), and [Event](/grow/acquire/campaigns/event/event-campaigns.md) campaigns, require information about how users engage with your app after installing it. Post-install event data informs Unity's models to more accurately show ads to your campaign's target au"
